    "turn_text": "true. The same operation as the one helping candidates here between here and November. But it, you know, you go to Iowa and you go to New Hampshire, people will draw their own conclusions. If we decide that we're going to do this, if we're going to present the case for Mike Pompeo for president, if we're going to do that, you can't do it from a standing start either. And so we're doing the kinds of things one might do, at least as we see it, to get ready for that moment. But it doesn't mean we've made our decision. I can assure you because I can even assure you more that we have not.",
