    "turn_idx": 32,
    "turn_text": "As you might know, or you probably noticed, I think I know for a fact you noticed, Kevin Kramer, Senator was on our show not too long ago. He's a very loyal Trump supporter, says so, doesn't hide that at all. But he also said, he thinks America's ready for a fresh start. And I said, oh, really? A fresh start from Donald Trump? He said, yes. And then he name checked you. Setting aside the name check, do you think America's ready for a fresh start from Donald Trump?",
