    "turn_idx": 33,
    "turn_text": "Oh, goodness. We'll let the American people sort that out in the end. You have a hunch on that? I think that when you're sitting here two and a half years out, no one really fully understands exactly where America will be at that point in time. And so there's still a lot of rocks to be turned over before you can really answer that question.",
