    "turn_idx": 34,
    "turn_text": "Would you serve? Let's just play this out. And I promise we'll get to other topics. I promise, but I'm a political and I got to go through this because I'm really interested. And I think our audience is too. If in fact Donald Trump were to run, claim the nomination and be elected. Would you serve in a Trump cabinet again?",
